{"page":414,"width":1674,"height":2530,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"474","words":[{"text":"474","x":188,"y":150,"width":55,"height":28}]},{"text":"Chapter 10 가통, 메모리","words":[{"text":"Chapter","x":311,"y":152,"width":113,"height":27},{"text":"10","x":438,"y":154,"width":34,"height":21},{"text":"가통,","x":501,"y":154,"width":40,"height":25},{"text":"메모리","x":550,"y":155,"width":61,"height":23}]},{"text":"심 사항은 페이지 테이블의 크기이다. 주어진 기장 공간에서 페이지 그기를 감소","words":[{"text":"심","x":313,"y":274,"width":26,"height":35},{"text":"사항은","x":354,"y":274,"width":90,"height":35},{"text":"페이지","x":457,"y":275,"width":84,"height":35},{"text":"테이블의","x":557,"y":275,"width":114,"height":36},{"text":"크기이다.","x":685,"y":275,"width":123,"height":36},{"text":"주어진","x":822,"y":275,"width":88,"height":35},{"text":"기장","x":925,"y":275,"width":60,"height":36},{"text":"공간에서","x":1100,"y":274,"width":124,"height":36},{"text":"페이지","x":1242,"y":274,"width":92,"height":36},{"text":"그기를","x":1352,"y":273,"width":96,"height":35},{"text":"감소","x":1461,"y":273,"width":59,"height":34}]},{"text":"시기는 것은 페이지의 수를 중가시기고, 결국 페이지 테이블의 그기를 증가시킨다. 예를","words":[{"text":"시기는","x":313,"y":332,"width":89,"height":35},{"text":"것은","x":416,"y":332,"width":58,"height":35},{"text":"페이지의","x":486,"y":333,"width":114,"height":35},{"text":"수를","x":614,"y":334,"width":60,"height":34},{"text":"중가시기고,","x":685,"y":333,"width":154,"height":35},{"text":"결국","x":855,"y":333,"width":57,"height":34},{"text":"페이지","x":925,"y":333,"width":87,"height":35},{"text":"테이블의","x":1029,"y":332,"width":120,"height":35},{"text":"그기를","x":1165,"y":332,"width":97,"height":34},{"text":"증가시킨다.","x":1275,"y":330,"width":170,"height":37},{"text":"예를","x":1461,"y":330,"width":60,"height":35}]},{"text":"들어, 4 MB (222) 가상 메모리에서는 페이지 크기가 1,024바이트인 경우 4,096페이지가","words":[{"text":"들어,","x":309,"y":390,"width":68,"height":34},{"text":"4","x":388,"y":394,"width":17,"height":26},{"text":"MB","x":417,"y":393,"width":52,"height":28},{"text":"(222)","x":482,"y":388,"width":61,"height":40},{"text":"가상","x":556,"y":391,"width":59,"height":35},{"text":"메모리에서는","x":625,"y":391,"width":176,"height":35},{"text":"페이지","x":813,"y":390,"width":84,"height":35},{"text":"크기가","x":912,"y":389,"width":91,"height":36},{"text":"1,024바이트인","x":1015,"y":389,"width":205,"height":36},{"text":"경우","x":1235,"y":390,"width":63,"height":34},{"text":"4,096페이지가","x":1309,"y":388,"width":212,"height":36}]},{"text":"존재하나 8,192바이트인 경우에는 512페이지만이 존재한다. 모든 활성 프로세스는 각자","words":[{"text":"존재하나","x":309,"y":448,"width":121,"height":34},{"text":"8,192바이트인","x":440,"y":449,"width":194,"height":34},{"text":"경우에는","x":648,"y":448,"width":116,"height":35},{"text":"512페이지만이","x":773,"y":448,"width":199,"height":35},{"text":"존재한다.","x":987,"y":446,"width":130,"height":36},{"text":"모든","x":1131,"y":449,"width":64,"height":31},{"text":"활성","x":1207,"y":447,"width":61,"height":34},{"text":"프로세스는","x":1284,"y":446,"width":163,"height":35},{"text":"각자","x":1459,"y":446,"width":61,"height":35}]},{"text":"의 페이지 테이블을 유지해야 하므로, 큰 페이지가 좋다.","words":[{"text":"의","x":309,"y":505,"width":26,"height":34},{"text":"페이지","x":350,"y":505,"width":86,"height":35},{"text":"테이블을","x":451,"y":507,"width":117,"height":35},{"text":"유지해야","x":579,"y":506,"width":118,"height":35},{"text":"하므로,","x":708,"y":506,"width":94,"height":35},{"text":"큰","x":814,"y":508,"width":30,"height":31},{"text":"페이지가","x":856,"y":504,"width":119,"height":37},{"text":"좋다.","x":986,"y":505,"width":67,"height":36}]},{"text":"반면에 할당해 준 메모리 시용 효올을 위해서는 작은 페이지가 좋다. 어떤 프로세스","words":[{"text":"반면에","x":364,"y":563,"width":88,"height":35},{"text":"할당해","x":466,"y":564,"width":86,"height":35},{"text":"준","x":566,"y":566,"width":30,"height":32},{"text":"메모리","x":608,"y":564,"width":84,"height":35},{"text":"시용","x":707,"y":564,"width":58,"height":35},{"text":"효올을","x":777,"y":563,"width":89,"height":35},{"text":"위해서는","x":879,"y":563,"width":121,"height":36},{"text":"작은","x":1012,"y":563,"width":62,"height":34},{"t